    m_Localized: WASD Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822144
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822145
    m_Localized: Walk with W, A, S and D.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822146
    m_Localized: Look around with the mouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822147
    m_Localized: Looking Around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822148
    m_Localized: Move the mouse to look around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822149
    m_Localized: Shift Sprint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822150
    m_Localized: Sprinting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822151
    m_Localized: Hold Shift while walking to sprint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822152
    m_Localized: Interaction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49090822153
    m_Localized: Aim at something nearby to see its key and name. Press F to use
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655830337355776
    m_Localized: Drawing Spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 655830354132992
    m_Localized: Draw with left-click on the Spell Practice tab of your codex. You
      can keep drawing within 3 seconds after letting go; after 3 seconds without
      drawing it is judged. Space judges right away, right-click or Esc cancels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103303975534592
    m_Localized: Left-click to draw a spell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894720
    m_Localized: Casting in the Field
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894721
    m_Localized: Left-click to draw in the middle of the screen. The pen follows
      your mouse, and you can keep drawing for 3 seconds after letting go. Press
      Space to judge right away. If it matches, aim for 3 seconds and left-click
      to fire (it fires on its own when time runs out). Right-click cancels. Fire
      and Water runes can be thrown on their own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894722
    m_Localized: Press M for the map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894723
    m_Localized: Map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103304004894724
    m_Localized: Walk to reveal the forest map. Revealed areas stay revealed. The
      minimap at the top right shows your surroundings; press M to see the whole
      forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
